{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000060","bookName":"Toda la ciudad me debe renta","cover":"","viewCount":822252,"followCount":13570,"introduction":" Valentina parece una casera común: anda en triciclo, carga sacos y cobra rentas. Pero es dueña de edificios, y hasta las 188 villas del exclusivo Residencial Bahía Dorada Uno son todas suyas. Un día, conoce a Gabriel, el actor más premiado, por una calle cerrada. Marco, su asistente, la mira con desprecio, mientras que Gabriel es más educado. Cuando Valentina los invita a su urbanización y ven filas de guardias recibiéndola, paraguas, vino servido, los dos quedan en shock.","chapterCount":72,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[340],"typeTwoNames":["Identidad Oculta"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":340,"name":"Identidad Oculta","replaceName":"identidad-oculta"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Identidad-Oculta","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Her-Fortune-Writes-the-Rules","bookNameLower":"her-fortune-writes-the-rules","shelfTime":"2025-11-06 13:49:25","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-06 13:49:25","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700003738","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":132595,"price":0},{"id":"700003739","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":153694,"price":0},{"id":"700003740","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":102366,"price":0},{"id":"700003741","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":97054,"price":0},{"id":"700003742","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":99614,"price":0},{"id":"700003743","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":106441,"price":0},{"id":"700003744","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":128734,"price":0},{"id":"700003745","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":108169,"price":0},{"id":"700003746","index":8,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":86494,"price":0},{"id":"700003747","index":